  "details": "Since Phys Bones is going to be a much more optimised way of having secondary motion compared to Dynamic Bones, I'd love to see a feature for adding wind to worlds that cause player Phys Bones to blow around.\nAs an example, imagine a world where there's some big dramatic portal opening in front of a group of players and when it opens have wind blowing through affecting the dynamics of the players.",
